## Why This Is Asked

Assesses ability to reason with 3-valued semantics under realistic, constraint-based settings and design a compact propagation+backtracking strategy.

## Key Concepts

- Kleene 3-valued logic: {T, F, U}
- A→B as ¬A ∨ B with ¬ and ∨ defined per Kleene semantics
- Constraint propagation and depth-limited backtracking
- Practical mapping to sensor fusion/telemetry validation in fleets

## Code Example

```javascript
const order = {F:0, U:1, T:2};
function not(v){ return v==='T'?'F': v==='F'?'T':'U';}
function or(a,b){ return (order[a] >= order[b]) ? a : b; }
function and(a,b){ return (order[a] <= order[b]) ? a : b; }
function implies(a,b){ return or(not(a), b); }
```

